"type": "LoadImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [440.390380859375, 631.39111328125], "pos": [2510.10498046875, 352.16351318359375], "id": 118, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "hasSecondTab": false, "image": "clipspace/clipspace-painted-masked-1770964415798.png [input]", "ver": "0.8.2", "widget_ue_connectable": {"image": true}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 2}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["提示词案例：\n\nuhdmanscale, fully reconstruct this entire image from cellphone quality to professional high resolution color raw quality. Remove halftone dot pattern. Apply descreen filter. Eliminate periodic grid noise. Eliminate repeating noise patterns and artifacts, remove uniform diagonal line texture patterns. Reconstruct low resolution high ISO noise areas with high resolution low ISO noise textures.\n\nuhdmanscale，从手机质量到专业高分辨率色彩原始质量，完全重建整个图像。消除半色调点图案。应用去屏住滤镜。消除周期性网格噪声。消除重复的噪声模式和伪影，消除统一的对角线线纹理模式。重建低分辨率高 ISO 噪声区域，使用高分辨率低 ISO 噪声纹理。\n\nApply full detail reconstruction to all areas: background, environment, surfaces, objects, clothing, and foreground elements — render everything sharp, textured, and high fidelity.\n\n应用全细节重建到所有区域：背景、环境、表面、对象、服装和前景元素——将所有内容渲染为锐利、有纹理和高保真。\n\nSubject identity is locked: preserve exact facial geometry and body geometry, eye shape and color, nose and mouth shape, and expression. On skin areas, remove color blotch artifacts, normalize tone uniformity, preserve natural pore and texture detail. On hair and body hair areas, separate smeared color artifacts, restore strand separation and texture. Outside the subject's face, freely reconstruct all texture and sharpness with no restrictions.\n\n主体身份锁定：保留面部和身体的精确几何形状、眼睛的形状和颜色、鼻子和嘴的形状以及表情。在皮肤区域，去除色斑，使色调均匀，保留自然毛孔和纹理细节。在头发和身体头发区域，分离色斑，恢复分段和纹理。在主体面部以外的区域，自由重建所有纹理和锐度，不受限制。\n\nDeblur and focus correction pass. Infer and reconstruct underlying detail from soft source: sharpen edge definition, recover eye detail, lip definition, and skin texture from motion blur. Output as professional high resolution color camera RAW image.\n\n模糊和聚焦校正通过。从软源中推断和重建基础细节：从运动模糊中锐化边缘定义、恢复眼部细节、嘴唇定义和皮肤纹理。输出专业高分辨率彩色相机 RAW 图像。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "type": "Note", "title": "提示词案例", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [615.7619018554688, 522.8892822265625], "pos": [2889.1728515625, -119.26244354248047], "id": 339, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [658], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "size": [287.6728210449219, 82], "pos": [2571.958984375, -188.85740661621094], "widgets_values": ["adonis_refine.safetensors", 1], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 657, "label": "model", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "lora_name"}, "name": "lora_name", "label": "lora_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "lora_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "strength_model"}, "name": "strength_model", "label": "strength_model", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "strength_model"}], "flags": {}, "id": 335, "type": "LoraLoaderModelOnly", "title": "Load Adonis Refine Model", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.18.1", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoraLoaderModelOnly"}, "order": 14}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [655, 657], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "size": [350.0915222167969, 82], "pos": [2508.417236328125, -56.81901168823242], "widgets_values": ["flux-2-klein-9b.safetensors", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "unet_name"}, "name": "unet_name", "label": "unet_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "unet_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "weight_dtype"}, "name": "weight_dtype", "label": "weight_dtype", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "weight_dtype"}], "flags": {}, "id": 318, "type": "UNETLoader